                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6ff87922-3cdf-3e19-8468-80d22931444b",
                        "entry_id": "54eb914d-cecc-3bb4-9968-537fc6f8c1f4",
                        "glosses": [
                            "screen, onscreen"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "not-comparable",
                            "relational"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2f41c55-3978-4c4f-be86-0631012e3bac",
                                "sense_id": "6ff87922-3cdf-3e19-8468-80d22931444b",
                                "text": "Near-synonyms: filmowy, telewizyjny"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d467c91-34fc-48ec-8157-f09b3923a848",
                                "sense_id": "6ff87922-3cdf-3e19-8468-80d22931444b",
                                "text": "czas ekranowy",
                                "translation": "screen time (duration something is visible)",
                                "english": "screen time (duration something is visible)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9fd4485c-309c-42bf-af08-01ea709839e1",
                                "sense_id": "6ff87922-3cdf-3e19-8468-80d22931444b",
                                "text": "drzwi ekranowe",
                                "translation": "(one of a series of doors at a train or subway station)",
                                "english": "(one of a series of doors at a train or subway station)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4dec96c2-8153-40a4-acce-9396bb747423",
                                "sense_id": "6ff87922-3cdf-3e19-8468-80d22931444b",
                                "text": "Możnaby sądzić, że rozmyślnie obniża się poziom filmu (scenarjusza), dopasowując go rzekomo do gustu najszerszych warstw publiczności, gdy tymczasem publiczność ta stoi o wiele wyżej pod względem smaku artystycznego, niż np. publiczność angielska, której wystarczają do emocji najprymitywniejsze środki artystyczne i oklepane łamańce komików ekranowych.",
                                "translation": "One might think, that the standard of the film (script) is being deliberately lowered, supposedly to suit the taste of the broadest sections of the audience, while in reality this audience is much higher in terms of artistic taste, than for example the English audience, which is satisfied with the most primitive artistic means and hackneyed jokes of screen comedians.",
                                "english": "One might think, that the standard of the film (script) is being deliberately lowered, supposedly to suit the taste of the broadest sections of the audience, while in reality this audience is much higher in terms of artistic taste, than for example the English audience, which is satisfied with the most primitive artistic means and hackneyed jokes of screen comedians."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
